{"parentUuid":"b260fa3b-e56c-4bc6-9f45-d7d9832b74a7","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8b9c6287-d7e2-4fd6-8dbd-dc6c5dce5337","agentId":"a8b24ce63139aab44","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NcciUN5KLUXeV9x1TUtSMR","type":"tool_result","content":"ls: cannot access 'mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py': No such file or directory\nwc: mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py: No such file or directory\n---tail parts.py conf pattern---\n11:UNKNOWN, never guessed):\n18:* ``UNKNOWN``       -- nothing credible found. ``number``/``price`` is\n23:was not found, the number is left ``None`` with ``confidence=UNKNOWN`` and\n24:a ``TECHAUTHORITY`` note. Images are link-only (never copied into this\n47:UNKNOWN = \"UNKNOWN\"\n49:CONFIDENCE_LEVELS = (CONFIRMED, CORROBORATED, SINGLE_SOURCE, UNKNOWN)\n51:TECHAUTHORITY = \"use the service manual (TechAuthority)\"\n77:         confidence: str = UNKNOWN, source: Optional[str] = None) -> dict[str, Any]:\n80:    if confidence == UNKNOWN and not note:\n81:        note = TECHAUTHORITY\n86:def _aftermarket(brand: str, number: Optional[str], confidence: str = UNKNOWN,\n201:    oem=[_oem(None, confidence=UNKNOWN)],\n217:    oem=[_oem(None, brand=\"n/a\", confidence=UNKNOWN,\n219:                   \"pass; buy to spec, not by part number. \" + TECHAUTHORITY)],\n262:    oem=[_oem(None, confidence=UNKNOWN,\n275:          + TECHAUTHORITY,\n368:    oem=[_oem(None, confidence=UNKNOWN,\n370:                   + TECHAUTHORITY)],\n402:             confidence=UNKNOWN,\n438:              \"independently verified this pass.\", confidence=UNKNOWN,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"83d0ed9f-2f36-4fe6-a5ea-f5d2902dd70d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T02:44:43.005Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ls: cannot access 'mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py': No such file or directory\nwc: mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py: No such file or directory\n---tail parts.py conf pattern---\n11:UNKNOWN, never guessed):\n18:* ``UNKNOWN``       -- nothing credible found. ``number``/``price`` is